Target recipe name: no-review
Base recipe: default (v1)

Base recipe summary:
### Recipe `default` (v1)

> Each task runs swe -> clean -> review -> integrate. SWE implements the change, runs lint and scoped tests, and opens a ready PR. Clean trims redundant comments and polishes the PR without changing behavior. Review checks the PR against the brief and the repository's documented gates; if review reports needs-swe, return to swe on the next round (up to 3 rounds, then escalate). Integrate uses the repository's documented merge path once review passes on the pinned HEAD.

| Phase | Agents | Mutating | Gates |
|---|---|---|---|
| swe | claude:opus(high) -> codex:gpt-5.4(high) | true | lint, scoped_tests, pr_open |
| clean | claude:sonnet(medium) -> codex:gpt-5.4-mini(medium) | true | lint, scoped_tests |
| review | claude:sonnet(high) -> codex:gpt-5.4(high) | false | review_head_pinned |
| integrate | claude:sonnet(medium) | true | review_approved |

| From | On | To | Advance Round |
|---|---|---|---|
| swe | verdict=done | clean | false |
| clean | verdict=done | review | false |
| review | verdict=done | integrate | false |
| review | verdict=needs-swe & round<=2 | swe | true |
| review | verdict=needs-swe & round>=3 | escalate | false |
| integrate | verdict=done | complete | false |
| integrate | verdict=needs-swe | swe | true |

Limits: max_rounds=3, max_phase_attempts=2, phase_timeout=45m0s, merge=controller

